1
00:03:04,197 --> 00:03:06,197


2
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

3
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

4
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

5
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

6
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

7
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

8
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

9
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

10
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

11
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

12
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

13
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

14
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

15
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Fifty-First Episode
King Neelon

16
00:03:06,221 --> 00:03:09,019
The fortress to the South has
been occupied by the enemy!

17
00:03:09,061 --> 00:03:11,177
All the soldiers in the
fortress have been killed!

18
00:03:11,221 --> 00:03:13,337
For the fortress to the
North there is no more hope!

19
00:03:14,461 --> 00:03:17,259
The fortress to the West is destroyed!

20
00:03:21,941 --> 00:03:24,091
Union X is now close.

21
00:03:24,781 --> 00:03:26,817
I had ordered that our army...

22
00:03:26,861 --> 00:03:28,817
...be divided into
four equal parts.

23
00:03:28,861 --> 00:03:32,410
...and defend the borders from the
East, West, North, and South fortresses!

24
00:03:32,941 --> 00:03:35,091
But there are no
troops in any fortress!

25
00:03:35,141 --> 00:03:37,735
Where the hell has the
Silverland army gone?

26
00:03:39,581 --> 00:03:42,812
Where has Geralamon gone
at this critical moment?

27
00:03:52,421 --> 00:03:54,696
You are late,
Grand Duke Geralamon.

28
00:03:54,741 --> 00:03:57,255
What happened
to the army of Silverland?

29
00:04:01,381 --> 00:04:03,451
Answer me, Grand Duke Geralamon!

30
00:04:21,221 --> 00:04:23,496
Have you gone mad, Prime Minister?!

31
00:04:27,181 --> 00:04:30,059
- It's Union X!
- Geralamon, what does this mean?

32
00:04:32,421 --> 00:04:34,855
I've taken out the dignitaries!

33
00:04:35,101 --> 00:04:38,855
These you see are
the brave warriors of Union X.

34
00:04:39,021 --> 00:04:42,093
From now on,
I will be the King of Silverland!

35
00:04:42,421 --> 00:04:44,571
You all, instead, will die!

36
00:04:44,621 --> 00:04:46,816
Grand Duke, you are a traitor!
It's the end for you!

37
00:04:49,741 --> 00:04:52,016
Help! Stop him!

38
00:04:53,741 --> 00:04:56,255
Kill those three nobodies!

39
00:05:12,701 --> 00:05:16,011
- Sapphire, come here!
- Stop them!

40
00:05:33,621 --> 00:05:35,816
This is the room of skeletons

41
00:05:36,941 --> 00:05:38,818
Come!

42
00:05:39,701 --> 00:05:42,773
Grand Duke Geralamon
has played a double game!

43
00:05:42,821 --> 00:05:44,857
Let's kill the traitor!

44
00:05:46,581 --> 00:05:50,051
All those who side
with the King... will die!

45
00:05:53,021 --> 00:05:55,455
Have you lost your mind,
Grand Duke Geralamon?

46
00:05:55,501 --> 00:05:59,016
We must defeat the Grand Duke
and help their Majesties!

47
00:06:00,421 --> 00:06:03,219
Very well... Very well...
I obey...

48
00:06:20,620 --> 00:06:24,660
Here is how those
who act against me will be treated!

49
00:06:31,900 --> 00:06:34,290
No one else will be able to enter
this room,

50
00:06:34,340 --> 00:06:36,332
unless they tear down the walls.

51
00:06:36,620 --> 00:06:38,816
We can't leave anymore either?

52
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:41,091
No, Sapphire.
Only you can do it.

53
00:06:41,740 --> 00:06:44,460
Listen: a long time ago,
there was a traitor.

54
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:47,340
The King and his family,
back then too, locked themselves away...

55
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:50,293
...in the room of skeletons
and the Prince...

56
00:06:50,340 --> 00:06:52,809
...managed to get out of here
on his own.

57
00:06:52,860 --> 00:06:55,011
He defeated the traitor
and liberated the country.

58
00:06:55,060 --> 00:06:57,780
- What became of the King and the Queen?
- They died in here,

59
00:06:57,820 --> 00:07:00,494
but the Prince rebuilt
this land beautifully.

60
00:07:00,540 --> 00:07:02,532
So, Zaffiro, you too..

61
00:07:02,580 --> 00:07:05,652
I can't!
I can't let you die! No!

62
00:07:06,620 --> 00:07:10,091
- My dear mom and dad...
- Poor Zaffiro, my daughter..!

63
00:07:10,140 --> 00:07:12,336
I will stay here with you.

64
00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:16,813
Zaffiro, you must respect
your father's will.

65
00:07:16,860 --> 00:07:19,534
Don't forget
that you will succeed me on the throne.

66
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:23,096
This is an order and you must
respect the King's orders!

67
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:26,770
Now you must flee from here and punish
the traitor at any cost!

68
00:07:27,020 --> 00:07:30,138
Look, Sapphire: this secret passage
is so narrow...

69
00:07:30,180 --> 00:07:32,331
...that only a child
can pass through it.

70
00:07:32,380 --> 00:07:35,373
You will leave through this passage
and take this with you.

71
00:07:38,380 --> 00:07:41,771
Legend says that the golden ball
represents the Royal Family,

72
00:07:41,820 --> 00:07:44,938
the silver one Silverland,
and the copper one the people!

73
00:07:44,980 --> 00:07:48,769
These three spheres have the power
to defend our beloved kingdom.

74
00:07:48,820 --> 00:07:51,494
Now move, my son,
you must go now!

75
00:07:52,140 --> 00:07:53,699
Father...

76
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:55,620
Courage.

77
00:07:55,660 --> 00:07:57,413
- Mother!
- Don't hesitate, Sapphire.

78
00:07:57,460 --> 00:08:00,214
Go and fight, Sapphire, for
the salvation of the kingdom!

79
00:08:00,260 --> 00:08:03,776
This is your destiny! Farewell,
Sapphire! Remember us.

80
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:05,812
- Sapphire!
- Dad! Mom!

81
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:08,614
I will return to save you,
so wait for me with faith!

82
00:08:22,020 --> 00:08:25,730
Get moving! Knock
down that rock! Hurry up!

83
00:08:51,221 --> 00:08:53,132
They all bear the mark of X.

84
00:08:55,461 --> 00:08:59,010
We must finish the
coronation ceremony of Plastic...

85
00:08:59,061 --> 00:09:02,292
...before X arrives. Gather
the men in the courtyard!

86
00:09:02,501 --> 00:09:04,139
Yes!

87
00:09:04,581 --> 00:09:07,698
Finally, now Silverland is mine!

88
00:09:14,941 --> 00:09:17,774
I am a messenger
of the Union X army.

89
00:09:17,821 --> 00:09:20,813
X and his army are
less than 5 kilometers from here.

90
00:09:20,861 --> 00:09:22,897
Is everything ready to receive them?

91
00:09:23,101 --> 00:09:25,217
5 kilometers from here?

92
00:09:25,261 --> 00:09:27,411
Then there is no time
for the ceremony!

93
00:09:27,461 --> 00:09:31,500
Listen to me, everyone! From this
moment, Plastic, my son,

94
00:09:31,541 --> 00:09:33,816
is crowned King of Silverland!

95
00:09:35,341 --> 00:09:38,413
And I, Geralamon,
will assume the regency.

96
00:09:38,941 --> 00:09:41,501
Does anyone have any objections?

97
00:09:51,181 --> 00:09:55,140
Ring the bell
to celebrate this event!

98
00:09:57,901 --> 00:10:00,540
One moment! I'll ring it!

99
00:10:02,901 --> 00:10:06,371
Because my son has become King!

100
00:10:17,141 --> 00:10:19,894
Neelon! You traitor!

101
00:10:24,061 --> 00:10:28,691
No! No! I have nothing to do with it! No! Help!

102
00:10:44,581 --> 00:10:47,812
Enough! Enough! Enough!

103
00:10:59,901 --> 00:11:02,017
I am the King now!

104
00:11:02,061 --> 00:11:04,211
I have become the King of Silverland!

105
00:11:05,821 --> 00:11:10,258
Page, clean my face at once!
Quick, you scoundrel! Quick!

106
00:11:14,901 --> 00:11:16,812
And now I want to eat!

107
00:11:18,541 --> 00:11:20,259
My back is stiff!

108
00:11:32,821 --> 00:11:34,732
Stop it!

109
00:11:34,901 --> 00:11:37,893
Who the hell are you?
Answer King Neelon!

110
00:11:37,941 --> 00:11:40,136
King Neelon, it's over for you!

111
00:11:47,501 --> 00:11:49,890
Ho... Ho... How dare you
to your King...?!

112
00:11:49,941 --> 00:11:52,739
- Which King?
- I... am the King!

113
00:12:00,581 --> 00:12:02,412
Where are you running?

114
00:12:14,461 --> 00:12:16,895
X is coming
with his army!

115
00:12:17,901 --> 00:12:20,290
What?! Finally!

116
00:12:20,341 --> 00:12:23,492
- I was waiting for you, dear X!
- Stop!

117
00:12:37,141 --> 00:12:39,814
Welcome, Excellency!
Welcome a thousand times!

118
00:12:39,861 --> 00:12:43,376
I love you! You don't know how
happy I am to see you, my friend!

119
00:12:43,421 --> 00:12:45,491
I couldn't wait for you to arrive!

120
00:12:45,541 --> 00:12:49,090
Help me, please! Kill this
guy who is chasing me!

121
00:13:11,821 --> 00:13:13,698
You finished him off!

122
00:13:13,741 --> 00:13:17,017
Listen, X:
this land will never die!

123
00:13:17,501 --> 00:13:19,492
As long as these three spheres exist,

124
00:13:19,541 --> 00:13:21,691
You will not be able to destroy
the kingdom of Silverland!

125
00:13:26,461 --> 00:13:28,531
Don't let him escape!

126
00:13:36,901 --> 00:13:39,335
The mysterious knight?!

127
00:14:01,901 --> 00:14:05,610
Dad, mom...
I'll come back with Franco to save you.

128
00:14:05,701 --> 00:14:07,692
Wait for me, please!

129
00:14:33,741 --> 00:14:35,493
Opale!

130
00:14:36,021 --> 00:14:37,898
And Sapphire? And Sapphire?

131
00:14:37,941 --> 00:14:41,616
Franco! Listen, Franco!
The King and Queen are in danger!

132
00:14:42,701 --> 00:14:45,898
Franco, why are you turning away?
What did I say? What's happening to you?

133
00:14:48,941 --> 00:14:51,409
How do you know what's happening
in the castle?

134
00:14:51,461 --> 00:14:54,180
You went there because you are
in love with Sapphire, right?

135
00:14:54,421 --> 00:14:56,457
Sapphire is closer to you than to me:

136
00:14:56,501 --> 00:14:59,459
that's why you know so well
what happens in the castle!

137
00:14:59,501 --> 00:15:03,494
Tell Sapphire that I don't want to
see her again! You take care of her!

138
00:15:04,341 --> 00:15:07,651
In reality, I am nothing,
absolutely nothing to her!

139
00:15:08,541 --> 00:15:11,009
I'm just a stupid stubborn fool!

140
00:15:12,181 --> 00:15:15,378
Goodbye.
Please, you protect Sapphire.

141
00:15:20,701 --> 00:15:23,215
- Opale, get out of the way!
- Franco!

142
00:15:34,661 --> 00:15:36,811
But then it's you, Sapphire?!

143
00:15:36,861 --> 00:15:39,091
And to think I had
never recognized you!

144
00:16:23,301 --> 00:16:26,532
We must free them! We must
free your father and your mother!

145
00:16:41,741 --> 00:16:44,016
They are no longer here.
They must have taken them...

146
00:16:44,061 --> 00:16:46,450
...and they must have locked them up in
some other part of the castle.

147
00:17:01,581 --> 00:17:03,776
Oh, no! They aren't even here!

148
00:17:03,821 --> 00:17:06,415
Oh, my dear mother and father!
Where are you?

149
00:17:06,901 --> 00:17:08,892
Take heart, Sapphire!

150
00:17:27,581 --> 00:17:30,698
Stay calm, Sapphire.
We will find them somewhere.

151
00:17:33,781 --> 00:17:36,693
X orders that anyone who finds
Princess Sapphire...

152
00:17:36,741 --> 00:17:39,050
...must execute her immediately,

153
00:17:39,101 --> 00:17:42,730
on pain of their own life! These
are the orders of the X Union!

154
00:17:45,261 --> 00:17:48,617
How are we going to get around the castle? It'll be full of soldiers!

155
00:17:49,221 --> 00:17:51,212
We have to try, Zaffiro.

156
00:17:51,261 --> 00:17:53,729
Remember what Union X commands you!

157
00:17:53,781 --> 00:17:57,854
- Where should we look? - We'll scour every corner of this castle.

158
00:17:58,061 --> 00:18:00,336
- Do you think we'll make it?
- Certainly.

159
00:18:00,381 --> 00:18:02,736
The trouble is, we don't have much time.

160
00:18:02,941 --> 00:18:07,059
Maybe it's best if we split up, that way we can search better. What do you say?

161
00:18:07,101 --> 00:18:09,934
- All right.
- Now, listen to me:

162
00:18:09,981 --> 00:18:12,620
you search on one side and I'll search on the other.

163
00:18:22,181 --> 00:18:25,139
So we are agreed,
we'll meet back here in thirty minutes.

164
00:18:25,181 --> 00:18:26,660
I'll go first.

165
00:18:47,301 --> 00:18:50,771
Greetings, Your Excellency!
What do you think of my idea?

166
00:18:50,821 --> 00:18:53,813
The news, by now, must have
reached every corner of the kingdom.

167
00:18:53,861 --> 00:18:55,931
Even the most remote!

168
00:18:56,341 --> 00:18:58,332
Zaffiro must have
found out about it...

169
00:18:58,381 --> 00:19:01,100
...and perhaps, by now, she is
already headed for the Northern pasture!

170
00:19:01,141 --> 00:19:03,018
It's a trap, just as I suspected.

171
00:19:03,061 --> 00:19:05,416
Baron Neelon,
you are speaking too loudly.

172
00:19:06,541 --> 00:19:08,532
You called me "Baron"?!

173
00:19:08,581 --> 00:19:10,890
Fool! I am the King,
don't you know?

174
00:19:11,141 --> 00:19:13,530
No, you are still Baron Neelon.

175
00:19:13,581 --> 00:19:15,492
X has decided this.

176
00:19:15,781 --> 00:19:19,091
How strange... His Excellency X
had promised to make me King!

177
00:19:19,141 --> 00:19:21,177
That's why I put on this crown!

178
00:19:21,221 --> 00:19:23,689
Excellency, you promised
that whoever received you...

179
00:19:23,741 --> 00:19:25,936
...would be King!
Isn't it true, Excellency?

180
00:19:34,781 --> 00:19:37,500
I never keep promises!

181
00:19:39,181 --> 00:19:42,014
What do you mean you
never keep promises?

182
00:19:42,101 --> 00:19:46,094
Yes, exactly. Do you have
anything to say about that, Neelon?

183
00:20:08,101 --> 00:20:10,661
Now I will go. You go
in the opposite direction.

184
00:20:10,701 --> 00:20:14,489
You'll see that everything will be fine.
We will find your parents, Sapphire.

185
00:20:19,541 --> 00:20:22,533
No! No! Away! Away! Go away!
Get out of here!

186
00:20:22,581 --> 00:20:26,096
No! No! No! Leave me alone! Away!

187
00:20:27,661 --> 00:20:29,492
Away! Away!

188
00:20:50,541 --> 00:20:53,613
Away! Away! Forgive me, Geralamon!
Do not hold a grudge against me!

189
00:20:53,661 --> 00:20:56,494
Please! I'll give this back to you!
Anything you want!

190
00:20:56,941 --> 00:21:00,013
Neelon, I will not forget
your betrayal!

191
00:21:00,061 --> 00:21:02,256
No! No! No, forgive me! No!

192
00:21:02,301 --> 00:21:04,895
I'm waiting for the King and the Queen
in hell,

193
00:21:04,941 --> 00:21:08,377
but they haven't arrived yet.
I have come to take them.

194
00:21:08,421 --> 00:21:10,412
Tell me, where are they now?

195
00:21:10,741 --> 00:21:13,096
The King and the Queen
are to be executed.

196
00:21:13,141 --> 00:21:16,770
...on Skeleton Island,
in the Western Sea, tonight!

197
00:21:17,181 --> 00:21:19,934
- Executed?!
- They were sent to the coast.

198
00:21:19,981 --> 00:21:22,290
..with a private carriage,
a few hours ago!

199
00:21:24,741 --> 00:21:26,936
Sapphire! Sapphire!

200
00:21:27,181 --> 00:21:29,570
"I am Sapphire.
I'm going to the North pasture.

201
00:21:29,621 --> 00:21:31,339
That's where my parents are"

202
00:21:34,661 --> 00:21:37,858
Dad! Mom! I'm coming to free you!

203
00:22:00,021 --> 00:22:03,013
- Didn't you know it was a trap?
- Damn it, Opal!

204
00:22:20,581 --> 00:22:22,492
Opal, let's try to escape!

205
00:22:40,941 --> 00:22:44,616
Quick, tell me the truth! Where
are the King and the Queen?

206
00:22:44,661 --> 00:22:47,380
We took them to
Skeleton Island...

207
00:22:47,421 --> 00:22:49,730
...and tonight they
will be executed.

208
00:22:49,781 --> 00:22:51,658
Executed?!

209
00:22:57,581 --> 00:23:01,620
God in heaven, please, protect
my mother and my father!

210
00:23:13,341 --> 00:23:15,935
Mom! Dad! Mom!

211
00:23:30,581 --> 00:23:32,811
The sun has already set.

212
00:23:49,101 --> 00:23:50,819
Franco!

213
00:23:56,581 --> 00:23:58,572
Where are my parents?

214
00:23:58,621 --> 00:24:00,896
I discovered the boat
that was about to set sail...

215
00:24:00,941 --> 00:24:03,409
...and I thought of getting
on to go and get them, but...

216
00:24:03,821 --> 00:24:06,096
Mom! Dad!

217
00:24:12,101 --> 00:24:15,218
Don't cry, Sapphire.
Now you have something to do!

218
00:24:17,301 --> 00:24:20,259
Mother! Father!

219
00:24:21,221 --> 00:24:25,373
Be strong, Sapphire. Now you have
a great task to fulfill:

220
00:24:25,421 --> 00:24:29,016
that of fighting to free
your country from the oppressor!

221
00:25:05,941 --> 00:25:09,561
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

222
00:25:09,562 --> 00:25:12,922
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

223
00:25:12,923 --> 00:25:16,693
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

224
00:25:16,694 --> 00:25:19,855
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

225
00:25:19,856 --> 00:25:23,669
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

226
00:25:23,670 --> 00:25:26,966
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

227
00:25:26,967 --> 00:25:30,972
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

228
00:25:30,973 --> 00:25:34,411
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

229
00:25:34,412 --> 00:25:38,032
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

230
00:25:38,033 --> 00:25:41,393
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

231
00:25:41,394 --> 00:25:45,164
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

232
00:25:45,165 --> 00:25:48,326
Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo!
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

233
00:25:48,350 --> 00:25:59,897
